  "sourceText": "Deviled Carrots\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Thursday, February 11, 2010 - 11:25pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n6 lrgs Carrots, quartered lengthwise\ncup Butter\n2 tablespoons Brown sugar\n2 teaspoons Dry mustard\nTabasco sauce\nteaspoon Salt\nFresh Ground black pepper\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Saute carrots in butter for 5 minutes. Add brown sugar, mustard, 2 drops Tabasco sauce, salt and pepper, cook for 10 minutes or until tender. 2 Serves 6.",
